    "detailed_description": "Tarisland, a new MMORPG, brings back the fun of challenging dungeons and\u00a0experiencing\u00a0immersive adventures in a classic fantasy art style. Choose from 9 classes and 18 specializations to create your build. Team up globally to conquer epic bosses!<br><br><strong>Explore the Vast World</strong><br>Dive into the vast realm of Tarisland, uncover hidden mysteries, and embark on your unique adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/e406c0c0339d3047ecfc8c84f14fa1f1.poster.avif?t=1731917720\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/e406c0c0339d3047ecfc8c84f14fa1f1.webm?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/e406c0c0339d3047ecfc8c84f14fa1f1.mp4?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Class &amp; Talent System</strong><br>Tarisland offers 9 unique classes, each with 2 specializations for you to choose from.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/7afcbaaf981959f5f7e26669633f622e.poster.avif?t=1731917720\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/7afcbaaf981959f5f7e26669633f622e.webm?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/7afcbaaf981959f5f7e26669633f622e.mp4?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create Your Own Build</strong><br>Each class features a flexible and extensive talent tree, easily customizable for different playstyles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/bae48b9de1e62432e29242b06ad6a99d.poster.avif?t=1731917720\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/bae48b9de1e62432e29242b06ad6a99d.webm?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/bae48b9de1e62432e29242b06ad6a99d.mp4?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Challenge Various Dungeons &amp; Raids</strong><br>Breathe new life into\u00a0the classic raid and dungeon system, team up to\u00a0take down\u00a0epic bosses!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/bad37cc604a63857f37e597ddb326dfe.poster.avif?t=1731917720\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/bad37cc604a63857f37e597ddb326dfe.webm?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/bad37cc604a63857f37e597ddb326dfe.mp4?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Enjoy the Game on Steam &amp; Mobile</strong><br>Available on both Steam and mobile with data-sharing enabled. Challenge dungeons and raids anytime, anywhere.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/94369c7ea2a73778b1fc67adb8b4e72e.poster.avif?t=1731917720\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/94369c7ea2a73778b1fc67adb8b4e72e.webm?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/94369c7ea2a73778b1fc67adb8b4e72e.mp4?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Trade in the Auction House</strong><br>Earn gold coins by trading in the Auction House! Collecting, mining, crafting, and engaging in other professions are other ways to earn rewards!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/8f52dece8d1465cfe077dd7d039910d3.poster.avif?t=1731917720\" width=616 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/8f52dece8d1465cfe077dd7d039910d3.webm?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/8f52dece8d1465cfe077dd7d039910d3.mp4?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Tarisland, a new MMORPG, brings back the fun of challenging dungeons and\u00a0experiencing\u00a0immersive adventures in a classic fantasy art style. Choose from 9 classes and 18 specializations to create your build. Team up globally to conquer epic bosses!<br><br><strong>Explore the Vast World</strong><br>Dive into the vast realm of Tarisland, uncover hidden mysteries, and embark on your unique adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/e406c0c0339d3047ecfc8c84f14fa1f1.poster.avif?t=1731917720\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/e406c0c0339d3047ecfc8c84f14fa1f1.webm?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/e406c0c0339d3047ecfc8c84f14fa1f1.mp4?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Class &amp; Talent System</strong><br>Tarisland offers 9 unique classes, each with 2 specializations for you to choose from.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/7afcbaaf981959f5f7e26669633f622e.poster.avif?t=1731917720\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/7afcbaaf981959f5f7e26669633f622e.webm?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/7afcbaaf981959f5f7e26669633f622e.mp4?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create Your Own Build</strong><br>Each class features a flexible and extensive talent tree, easily customizable for different playstyles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/bae48b9de1e62432e29242b06ad6a99d.poster.avif?t=1731917720\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/bae48b9de1e62432e29242b06ad6a99d.webm?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/bae48b9de1e62432e29242b06ad6a99d.mp4?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Challenge Various Dungeons &amp; Raids</strong><br>Breathe new life into\u00a0the classic raid and dungeon system, team up to\u00a0take down\u00a0epic bosses!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/bad37cc604a63857f37e597ddb326dfe.poster.avif?t=1731917720\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/bad37cc604a63857f37e597ddb326dfe.webm?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/bad37cc604a63857f37e597ddb326dfe.mp4?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Enjoy the Game on Steam &amp; Mobile</strong><br>Available on both Steam and mobile with data-sharing enabled. Challenge dungeons and raids anytime, anywhere.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/94369c7ea2a73778b1fc67adb8b4e72e.poster.avif?t=1731917720\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/94369c7ea2a73778b1fc67adb8b4e72e.webm?t=1731917720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v